cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Demetrios in research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Demetrios: A Systems and Scientific Programming Language with Epistemic Computing"
abstract: >-
  Demetrios is a novel systems and scientific programming language featuring
  first-class epistemic computing (confidence, provenance, uncertainty),
  compile-time units of measure, SMT-backed refinement types, algebraic effects,
  linear/affine types, GPU-native syntax, and scientific ontology integration.
